{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Financial Quest Turned Adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a reckless adventurer who burned down a tavern\u2014and now owes 1,000,000 gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay up\u2026 or fight your way to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step can lead to riches, danger, or absurd misfortune.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Path:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade on a volatile coin market \u2014 buy low, sell high\u2026 or lose everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 50+ enemies and elite bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter hundreds of events \u2014 from lucky bags to mysterious figures in the woods.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop Your Hero:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and allocate stat points: Strength, Intelligence, Luck, Defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons, potions, and powerful pets to aid your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress, fail, adapt \u2014 every decision counts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles using normal attacks and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use potions: Immortality, Stone Skin, Damage Boost, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step can trigger a fight \u2014 or something far worse.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878870?t=1774545874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878870/626d928ede0105c73138088f8ab0cde35c6ccf81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774545874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878870/2473b039de3d328827fbdcb4bd7bbb60800e55e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=